      "publishedAt": "2026-10-18T23:43:09.000Z",
      "snippet": " <p><strong>Release:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/simonw/llm-tools-datasette/releases/tag/0.1.1\">llm-tools-datasette 0.1.1</a></p> <p>When I switched LLM over to <a href=\"https://github.com/pydantic/httpx2\">httpx2</a> in <a href=\"https://llm.datasette.io/en/stable/changelog.html#v0-33\">LLM 0.33</a> I forget that this would break any plugins which used <code>httpx</code> without directly depending on it. <code>llm-tools-datasette</code> was one of those plugins, now fixed.</p> <p>Tags: <a",
