      "snippet": " <p><strong>Release:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/simonw/llm-echo/releases/tag/0.5\">llm-echo 0.5</a></p> <p>I'm working towards a new <a href=\"https://llm.datasette.io/\">LLM</a> release, and testing PRs caused me to revisit the <code>llm-echo</code> debug plugin. This plugin provides a \"model\" which doesn't involve an LLM at all - it just repeats back the prompts that have been fed to it. The new release now updates the simulated token usage counts to take tool calls, system prompts, and",
